---
import { Mic, ExternalLink } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section id="podcast" class="relative section-padding overflow-hidden" style="background: hsl(210, 20%, 96%);">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="font-body text-sm tracking-[0.3em] text-primary uppercase mb-3">Where You&rsquo;ve Seen Me</p>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display mb-6 pt-1" style="color: hsl(215, 30%, 12%);">
          Speaking &amp; <span class="font-accent text-5xl md:text-6xl gradient-text leading-relaxed">Podcast</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="font-body leading-relaxed mb-6" style="color: hsl(215, 15%, 40%);">
          Steve brings a humble intensity that is palpable. No screaming or antics needed &mdash;
          only the thoughtful insights of someone who&rsquo;s been doing this for almost two decades.
        </p>
        <p class="font-body leading-relaxed mb-8" style="color: hsl(215, 15%, 40%);">
          Steve has spoken on the same stage as some of the most prominent entrepreneurs in the world,
          including Leila and Alex Hormozi, Bedros Keuilian, Tom Bilyeu, Ed Mylett, and Nick Santonastasso.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/speaking"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 gradient-accent text-primary-foreground font-body text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase px-8 py-3 rounded-sm hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity"
        >
          Book Steve to Speak <ExternalLink className="w-4 h-4" />
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="border rounded-sm p-8" style="background: white; border-color: hsl(215, 15%, 85%);">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 gradient-accent rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center">
            <Mic className="w-7 h-7 text-primary-foreground" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl" style="color: hsl(215, 30%, 12%);">Featured Episode</h3>
            <p class="font-body text-sm" style="color: hsl(215, 15%, 40%);">Build Your Wealth Muscle &middot; Ep. 70</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="font-body leading-relaxed text-sm mb-6" style="color: hsl(215, 15%, 40%);">
          Growing sales &amp; revenue for entrepreneurs can be a challenge... but converting
          that business success into wealth can be even harder. Learn actionable strategies
          for building and protecting wealth.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/2JBnx0FGduPrmlv65wdj7p"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-body text-sm text-accent hover:text-primary transition-colors"
        >
          Listen on Spotify <ExternalLink className="w-4 h-4" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
